<br>
I am good friends with Hannem and have hunted with Hexem though it's been a while back.  CoM was a fun place in the 40's <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :) --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/smile.gif ALT=":)"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END-->    I'm sure there are others in Deus who I have no doubt grouped with in my 65+ days.<br>
<br>
I would like to attend one of your upcoming raids so that we can get to know eachother better.  I am an experienced planes raider with multiple trips to Fear, Hate, and Sky under my belt as well as an Inny kill back on the Rathe.  I'm currently friendly with Coldain and Dragons, and have hunted in Kael Arena area on a number of occasions.  <br>
<br>
As goals, I'm working dilegently on my Epic swords, and want to strive hard to make the status of Outrider before things are all said and done.<br>
<br>
I also have a 50th level dwarven cleric named Kadusas Medicus.<br>
<br>
You can e-mail me at Relkeb@hotmail.com or reply here as I'll be cheching back.  Thanks. <p>Relkeb Ravenhawk 52nd Pathfinder<br>
Citizen of Surfall Glade</p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/urelkeb.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Relkeb</A> at: 6/12/01 10:53:27 am<br></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#999999><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub14.ezboard.com/udauldon.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Dauldon</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Deus Factum</span><br> <font color=#000000>(6/12/01 12:14:51 pm)</font><br>    <BR><img src=http://www.deusfactum.com/img.usr/DauldonImg.jpg height='180' width='140'></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Looking to join</span><hr size=1> Hello lad, glad ye found the message board.  As I told ye I'm not sure what the current status of membership be, if'in we be takin' new members o not.  I do know if'in ye group with us often enough and we seem to be of liked minds ye just may get an invite.<br>
<br>
Again, I'm not certain but what I said can't hurt if'in ye do it. <p><hr WIDTH="100%">
